MatPilot uses Blockly for the block editor on /blocks
(docs/adr/0008-block-editor.md). Its JavaScript is bundled into the site, and
its media (images and cursors, from node_modules/blockly/media/) are copied to
/vendor/blockly-media/ by scripts/vendor-assets.mjs. MatPilot's blocks, their
Python, the toolbox and the themes are MatPilot's own code
(src/lib/blocks/); no Blockly source is modified.
